<title>DUBAI: Force 4.6 quake hits southern Iranian town.</title>
<headline>Force 4.6 quake hits southern Iranian town.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>An earthquake measuring 4.6 on the Richter scale jolted the area around the town of Lar in the southern Iranian province of Fars, Iran's official news agency IRNA reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>There was no immediate word on casualties and damage, it said.</p>
<p>Iran has been hit by at least three major erarthquakes in the past year as well as scores of tremors and thousands of aftershocks.</p>
